// The feel lab: the standard movement tests, in grey. Tiles are 16 x 16; entity positions are in tiles.
//
// From the spawn, left to right along the floor:
//   a staircase of ledges, each one tile higher than the last (x 12-26);
//   a long run under a low ceiling with three tiles of headroom, its corner at x 40;
//   a ceiling shelf at x 58-62 to jump up past, nudged round its corners;
//   gaps of 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 and 7 tiles for a running jump, then 9 and 10 for a jump and Lunge,
//   each over a shallow pit you can jump back out of;
//   a wall shaft three tiles wide at x 163-165, climbed with wall jumps.
// The shaft opens onto an upper corridor that runs back to a drop near the spawn.
// Going left, its walls are four tiles high (a full jump), then seven tiles with a three-tile step
// (a full jump from the step), seven tiles (jump and Swoon) and three tiles (a hop).
[room]
name = lab

[legend]
# stone
= wood

[tiles]
